<Section label="About me" id="about">
  <div class="prose">
    <p>I study Computer Science at <strong>Universiti Teknologi PETRONAS</strong>, majoring in cybersecurity with a minor in corporate management. Alongside my degree I work part-time as a DevOps engineer at ERS Energy, where I look after Linux servers, plan self-hosted infrastructure and keep server access secure and traceable.</p>
    <p>The work I care about most sits where security meets policy: governance, risk and compliance. I play CTFs on the blue-team side, mostly OSINT and memory forensics, and I teach Volatility3 workshops to other students. Outside tech I serve as a youth representative on Dewan Belia Perak and as Information Chief of PGP Perak.</p>
    <p>I will be graduating in December 2026 and currently maintaining CGPA of 3.65, and I am looking for graduate roles in GRC, Cybersecurity or DevOps.</p>
  </div>
